--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Story_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4291ee1ab1f7e1645a1b4a44efaaa0af, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 2532302848
    m_Localized: Once, in a kingdom that no longer remembers its name, a knight came
      home to his family.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217408
    m_Localized: That night, the ground split open, and Hell came up through it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217409
    m_Localized: The knight's sword struck the Demon King true, and shattered like
      glass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217410
    m_Localized: When the fires went out, the house was empty. His family was gone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217411
    m_Localized: 'The demons went back down: past the dungeons, past the caves, into
      Hell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217412
    m_Localized: Many had sworn revenge on Hell. None came back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217413
    m_Localized: With no sword, the knight came to an empty field under an unfinished
      sky.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217414
    m_Localized: Learn to move, knight. The deep places are not kind to the clumsy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217415
    m_Localized: No blade? Then fists. Hit them like you mean it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217416
    m_Localized: Drink when you must. There are no inns in Hell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217417
    m_Localized: These gauntlets belonged to a knight who went before you. They remember
      how to fight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217418
    m_Localized: Courage, pressed hard enough, becomes stone. Rough stones become
      Flawless ones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217419
    m_Localized: A shrine. The old spirits still answer, once each.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217420
    m_Localized: The way down is open. Somewhere below, the ones who did this are
      waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217421
    m_Localized: The dungeon smelled of rust and old promises.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217422
    m_Localized: Somewhere below, the Demon King. Somewhere between, everything that
      wanted the knight dead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217424
    m_Localized: ...is that you? You came back...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217425
    m_Localized: The voices came from everywhere and nowhere, as voices do in stories
      like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217426
    m_Localized: The torches died one by one, as if the room were holding its breath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217427
    m_Localized: You! The little knight with the glass sword.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217428
    m_Localized: Revenge? I don't even remember their faces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217429
    m_Localized: ENOUGH! Let's see you dodge THIS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217430
    m_Localized: This... isn't how it was supposed to end...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217431
    m_Localized: The Demon King fell. It did not feel the way the knight had hoped.
      So he went deeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217432
    m_Localized: Below the dungeon, the earth opened like an old wound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217433
    m_Localized: The knight did not look back. Knights in stories rarely do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217434
    m_Localized: You again. ...No. Someone like you. Choose, little knight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217435
    m_Localized: Don't go any further. Please. Come home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217436
    m_Localized: In the heart of the caves sat the Lord of Ruin, who had been waiting
      longer than the stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217437
    m_Localized: Ah. You're early. Or is it late? It is so hard to keep the pages
      straight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217438
    m_Localized: Let us see if this one ends differently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217439
    m_Localized: Go on, then. Something is waiting at the bottom. Something always
      is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217440
    m_Localized: I hope it gives you what you want.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217441
    m_Localized: And at last, Hell. Hotter than the stories said. Quieter, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217442
    m_Localized: Somewhere in all that fire was whoever had sent the demons. The
      knight would find them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217443
    m_Localized: Hell holds on to what it catches. Mostly knights.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217444
    m_Localized: It won't bring us back. You know that, don't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217445
    m_Localized: And the knight cut down the last of them, and Hell was quiet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217446
    m_Localized: His family was avenged. The kingdom would sing of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217447
    m_Localized: ...Is that it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217448
    m_Localized: The end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217449
    m_Localized: ...Again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217450
    m_Localized: No, no. That isn't how it goes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217451
    m_Localized: And the knight fell. ...Let's try that again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217452
    m_Localized: That's not the ending. Not yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217453
    m_Localized: Somewhere above, a house stood empty, and waited.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217454
    m_Localized: Every story has a page like this one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217455
    m_Localized: The knight got up. Knights in stories always do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217456
    m_Localized: Hm. I'll tell that part better next time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217457
    m_Localized: That was not the brave part.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217458
    m_Localized: A sword would have helped. If it hadn't broken.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217459
    m_Localized: Again, then. From the top.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217460
    m_Localized: Down, but not done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217461
    m_Localized: The story paused, and waited for its knight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217462
    m_Localized: Brutus laughed, and the dungeon laughed with him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217463
    m_Localized: '"Not this time either," said the Lord of Ruin.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217464
    m_Localized: Once, in a kingdom that no longer remembers its name...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217465
    m_Localized: From the beginning, then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217466
    m_Localized: Two pairs of gauntlets. Two knights who never came home. Choose
      one to carry on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217467
    m_Localized: Every knight who came before wore the same gauntlets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217468
    m_Localized: Gems are courage, pressed until it shines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217469
    m_Localized: The Demon King has never lost a fight. Until he does.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2595217470
    m_Localized: No one remembers the faces of the knight's family. Not even the
      Narrator.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 394249618055168
    m_Localized: And then there was one more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
